OL,3,ASerious pollution by water industry
OL,4,Aremains high despite #5bn investment
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe environmental performance of water
OL,7,Fcompanies fell again last year despite
OL,8,Findustry investment, according to the
OL,9,Ffirst joint report by the regulators.
OL,11,FEight of the nine companies in England
OL,12,Fwere rated as "poor" or "requiring
OL,13,Fimprovement", with only Severn Trent
OL,14,Freceiving the highest rating.
OL,16,FCompanies were praised for reducing
OL,17,Fservice disruptions but serious
OL,18,Fpollution into the environment remained
OL,19,Fa "major concern".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
